WEBVTT

00:00:06.893 --> 00:00:09.678
[ BREATHING SHARPLY ]

00:00:09.722 --> 00:00:12.507
DO I DETECT ELM?

00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:15.292
Yes, my Lord.
AH.

00:00:20.559 --> 00:00:23.387
AND THE CORE?

00:00:23.431 --> 00:00:26.129
Dragon.
[ CLEARS THROAT ]

00:00:26.173 --> 00:00:27.696
DRAGON HEARTSTRING,
MY LORD.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.219
DRAGON HEARTSTRING.

00:00:29.263 --> 00:00:31.918
MM-HMM.

00:00:34.442 --> 00:00:36.488
[ CLATTER ][ GASPS ]

00:00:39.012 --> 00:00:40.622
[ CLICKS TONGUE ]

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:42.929
[ INHALES SHARPLY ]

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:45.845
[ MOANING ]

00:00:45.888 --> 00:00:48.064
Voldemort:
TO THOSE OF YOU WHO DO NOT KNOW,

00:00:48.108 --> 00:00:50.414
WE ARE JOINED TONIGHT
BY MISS CHARITY BURBAGE,

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:52.025
WHO, UNTIL RECENTLY,

00:00:52.068 --> 00:00:56.072
TAUGHT AT HOGWARTS SCHOOL
OF WITCHCRAFT AND WIZARDRY.

00:00:56.116 --> 00:00:59.467
HER SPECIALITY
WAS MUGGLE STUDIES.

00:00:59.511 --> 00:01:01.861
[ LIGHT LAUGHTER ]

00:01:01.904 --> 00:01:06.039
IT IS MISS BURBAGE'S BELIEF
THAT MUGGLES...

00:01:06.082 --> 00:01:09.172
ARE NOT SO DIFFERENT FROM US.

00:01:09.216 --> 00:01:13.612
SHE WOULD, GIVEN HER WAY...

00:01:13.655 --> 00:01:15.701
HAVE US MATE WITH THEM.

00:01:15.744 --> 00:01:17.964
[ GROANS ][ LAUGHTER ]

00:01:18.007 --> 00:01:23.143
TO HER, THE MIXTURE
OF MAGICAL AND MUGGLE BLOOD

00:01:23.186 --> 00:01:25.319
IS NOT AN ABOMINATION

00:01:25.362 --> 00:01:27.408
BUT SOMETHING TO BE ENCOURAGED.

00:01:27.451 --> 00:01:28.757
[ GASPING ]

00:01:28.801 --> 00:01:31.717
S-S-SEVERUS.
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:34.589
SEVERUS, PLEASE.

00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:37.679
[ Sobbing ]
WE'RE FRIENDS.

00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:41.030
[ SOBBING ]

00:01:41.074 --> 00:01:42.728
AVADA KEDAVRA!

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:48.777
[ INHALES SHARPLY ]

00:01:53.652 --> 00:01:55.697
NAGINI...

00:01:58.352 --> 00:02:01.007
...DINNER.

00:02:36.129 --> 00:02:39.306
[ HEDWIG CHIRPING ]

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.024
[ CHIRPING CONTINUES ]

00:03:36.711 --> 00:03:39.540
[ MOTORCYCLE ENGINE APPROACHES ]

00:03:45.851 --> 00:03:47.374
Hagrid:
HELLO, HARRY!

00:03:47.417 --> 00:03:49.289
[ EXHALES DEEPLY ]
ALL RIGHT!

00:03:49.332 --> 00:03:51.378
[ Chuckling ] WOW!
HELLO!

00:03:51.421 --> 00:03:53.206
[ CHUCKLES ]YOU'RE LOOKING FIT.

00:03:53.249 --> 00:03:54.729
YEAH, HE'S
ABSOLUTELY GORGEOUS.

00:03:54.773 --> 00:03:57.210
WHAT SAY WE GET UNDERCOVER
BEFORE SOMEONE MURDERS HIM?

00:03:57.253 --> 00:03:58.472
EVENING.

00:03:58.515 --> 00:04:00.692
[ GRUNTS ]

00:04:02.911 --> 00:04:04.957
KINGSLEY, I THOUGHT
YOU WERE LOOKING AFTER
THE PRIME MINISTER.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.002
YOU ARE
MORE IMPORTANT.

00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:08.917
HELLO, HARRY.

00:04:08.961 --> 00:04:10.876
BILL WEASLEY.OH, F--
PLEASURE TO MEET YOU.

00:04:10.919 --> 00:04:12.573
HE WAS NEVER ALWAYS
THIS HANDSOME.HARRY!

00:04:12.616 --> 00:04:14.270
DEAD UGLY.

00:04:14.314 --> 00:04:15.750
[ CHUCKLES ]
TRUE ENOUGH.

00:04:15.794 --> 00:04:18.535
OWE IT ALL TO A WEREWOLF,
NAME OF GREYBACK.

00:04:18.579 --> 00:04:20.581
HOPE TO REPAY THE FAVOR
ONE DAY.

00:04:20.624 --> 00:04:22.061
WELL, YOU'RE STILL BEAUTIFUL
TO ME, WILLIAM.

00:04:22.104 --> 00:04:23.671
[ SMOOCHES ]
Lupin:
JUST REMEMBER, FLEUR...

00:04:23.715 --> 00:04:26.065
BILL TAKES HIS STEAKS
ON THE RAW SIDE NOW.

00:04:26.108 --> 00:04:28.545
[ HERMIONE LAUGHS ]MY HUSBAND, THE JOKER.

00:04:28.589 --> 00:04:31.418
BY THE WAY,
WAIT TILL YOU HEAR THE NEWS.

00:04:31.461 --> 00:04:33.072
REMUS AND I --OH, ALL RIGHT!
ALL RIGHT!

00:04:33.115 --> 00:04:34.682
WE'LL HAVE TIME
FOR A COZY CATCH-UP LATER.

00:04:34.726 --> 00:04:37.772
WE'VE GOT TO GET THE HELL
OUT OF HERE...AND SOON!

00:04:37.816 --> 00:04:39.208
POTTER, YOU'RE UNDERAGE,

00:04:39.252 --> 00:04:41.689
WHICH MEANS YOU'VE STILL
GOT THE TRACE ON YOU.

00:04:41.733 --> 00:04:43.386
WHAT'S THE TRACE?WHY, IF YOU SNEEZE,

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.171
THE MINISTRY WILL KNOW
WHO WIPES YOUR NOSE.

00:04:45.214 --> 00:04:47.695
THE POINT IS WE HAVE TO USE
THOSE MEANS OF TRANSPORT

00:04:47.739 --> 00:04:50.045
THE TRACE CAN'T DETECT --
BROOMS, THESTRALS, AND THE LIKE.

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:51.699
WE GO IN PAIRS.

00:04:51.743 --> 00:04:54.049
THAT WAY, IF ANYONE'S
OUT THERE WAITING FOR US --

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:55.747
AND I RECKON THERE WILL BE --

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.140
THEY WON'T KNOW WHICH
HARRY POTTER IS THE REAL ONE.

00:04:58.184 --> 00:04:59.794
THE REAL ONE?

00:04:59.838 --> 00:05:04.190
I BELIEVE YOU'RE FAMILIAR
WITH THIS PARTICULAR BREW.

00:05:04.233 --> 00:05:05.887
NO. ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:05:05.931 --> 00:05:08.629
I TOLD YOU
HE'D TAKE IT WELL.

00:05:08.672 --> 00:05:10.849
UH, NO. IF YOU THINK
I'M GONNA LET EVERYONE
RISK THEIR LIVES FOR ME,

00:05:10.892 --> 00:05:13.329
I-I --[ SCOFFS ] NEVER DONE
THAT BEFORE, HAVE WE?

00:05:13.373 --> 00:05:14.722
NO!
NO. THIS IS DIFFERENT.

00:05:14.766 --> 00:05:16.942
I MEAN, TAKING THAT,
BECOMING ME -- NO!

00:05:16.985 --> 00:05:18.857
WELL, NONE OF US
REALLY FANCY IT, MATE.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.597
YEAH. IMAGINE
IF SOMETHING WENT WRONG

00:05:20.641 --> 00:05:22.295
AND WE ENDED UP
A SCRAWNY, SPECKY GIT FOREVER.

00:05:22.338 --> 00:05:23.557
[ SIGHS ]

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:25.037
EVERYONE HERE
IS OF AGE, POTTER.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:26.995
THEY'VE ALL AGREED
TO TAKE THE RISK.

00:05:27.039 --> 00:05:28.388
[ MUNDUNGUS CLEARS THROAT ]

00:05:28.431 --> 00:05:31.043
TECHNICALLY,
I'VE BEEN COERCED.

00:05:31.086 --> 00:05:33.349
MUNDUNGUS FLETCHER,
MR. POTTER.

00:05:33.393 --> 00:05:35.438
ALWAYS BEEN
A HUGE ADMIRER.

00:05:35.482 --> 00:05:37.484
NIP IT, MUNDUNGUS!

00:05:37.527 --> 00:05:39.747
ALL RIGHT, GRANGER,
AS DISCUSSED.

00:05:39.791 --> 00:05:41.575
[ HAIR TEARS ]BLIMEY, HERMIONE!

00:05:41.618 --> 00:05:43.316
STRAIGHT IN HERE,
IF YOU PLEASE.

00:05:43.359 --> 00:05:46.841
[ FIZZING ]

00:05:46.885 --> 00:05:49.670
[ LIQUID SLOSHING ]

00:05:52.978 --> 00:05:56.285
FOR THOSE OF YOU WHO HAVEN'T
TAKEN POLYJUICE POTION BEFORE,

00:05:56.329 --> 00:05:59.201
FAIR WARNING --
IT TASTES LIKE GOBLIN PISS.

00:05:59.245 --> 00:06:02.552
HAVE A LOT OF EXPERIENCES
WITH THAT, DO YOU, MAD-EYE?

00:06:02.596 --> 00:06:05.294
JUST TRYING TO DEFUSE
THE TENSION.

00:06:06.774 --> 00:06:08.254
[ GRUNTS ]

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:13.433
UGH!

00:06:13.476 --> 00:06:14.782
[ GASPS ]

00:06:14.826 --> 00:06:16.001
[ GASPS ]

00:06:16.044 --> 00:06:18.481
Mundungus: UGH!

00:06:18.525 --> 00:06:20.353
[ GROANS ]

00:06:20.396 --> 00:06:22.181
[ GASPS ]

00:06:22.224 --> 00:06:23.617
[ GROANS ]

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:26.533
[ GROANS ]

00:06:26.576 --> 00:06:28.404
[ GROANING ]

